{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbs","name":"Biblica® 圣经当代译本开放资源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBS","englishName":"Mandarin Chinese Open Contemporary Bible (Simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"74bf453a33641322ae4ddd23e051ee64d1412722972e541371ef97308285fe7d","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"GEN","translationId":"cmn_cbs","name":"创世记","commonName":"创世记","title":"创世记","order":1,"numberOfChapters":50,"sha256":"10a45bcf2ede9deb41605171c53170d502fcae5c3b35e4565dec7e08e91d0387","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/GEN/1.json","lastChapterNumber":50,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/GEN/50.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1531},"chapter":{"number":11,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["巴别塔"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["那时，天下人都用同一种语言，讲同一种话。"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["人们向东迁移时，在示拿地区找到一处平原，定居下来。"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["他们彼此商量说：“来呀，我们制作砖，把砖烧透吧。”他们用砖作石块，用柏油作灰泥来造塔，"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["说：“来吧，让我们造一座城和一座高耸入云的塔，这样我们可以为自己扬名，不致分散在普天之下。”"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["耶和华下来察看人建造的城和塔。"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["耶和华说：“看啊，他们同属一个民族，都用同一种语言，现在就开始做这样的事，如果继续下去，他们会为所欲为。"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["来吧，我们下去变乱他们的语言，使他们彼此言语不通。”"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["于是，耶和华把他们从那里分散到普天之下，他们便停止建城了。"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["因此，人称那城为巴别，因为耶和华在那里变乱了世人的语言，把他们分散到普天之下。"]},{"type":"heading","content":["闪的后代"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["以下是闪的后代。 洪水过后两年，闪一百岁时生亚法撒，"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["之后又活了五百年，生儿育女。"]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["亚法撒三十五岁时生沙拉，"]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":["之后又活了四百零三年，生儿育女。"]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":["沙拉三十岁时生希伯，"]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":["之后又活了四百零三年，生儿育女。"]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":["希伯三十四岁时生法勒，"]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":["之后又活了四百三十年，生儿育女。"]},{"type":"verse","number":18,"content":["法勒三十岁时生拉吴，"]},{"type":"verse","number":19,"content":["之后又活了二百零九年，生儿育女。"]},{"type":"verse","number":20,"content":["拉吴三十二岁时生西鹿，"]},{"type":"verse","number":21,"content":["之后又活了二百零七年，生儿育女。"]},{"type":"verse","number":22,"content":["西鹿三十岁时生拿鹤，"]},{"type":"verse","number":23,"content":["之后又活了二百年，生儿育女。"]},{"type":"verse","number":24,"content":["拿鹤二十九岁时生他拉，"]},{"type":"verse","number":25,"content":["之后又活了一百一十九年，生儿育女。"]},{"type":"verse","number":26,"content":["他拉七十岁后，生了亚伯兰、拿鹤和哈兰。"]},{"type":"heading","content":["他拉的后代"]},{"type":"verse","number":27,"content":["以下是他拉的后代。 他拉生亚伯兰、拿鹤和哈兰，哈兰生罗得。"]},{"type":"verse","number":28,"content":["哈兰比他父亲他拉先去世，他死在自己的家乡迦勒底的吾珥。"]},{"type":"verse","number":29,"content":["亚伯兰和拿鹤都娶了妻子，亚伯兰的妻子名叫撒莱，拿鹤的妻子名叫密迦，是哈兰的女儿。哈兰是密迦和亦迦的父亲。"]},{"type":"verse","number":30,"content":["撒莱不能生育，没有孩子。"]},{"type":"verse","number":31,"content":["他拉带着儿子亚伯兰、孙子——哈兰的儿子罗得、儿媳妇——亚伯兰的妻子撒莱，离开迦勒底的吾珥前往迦南，他们来到哈兰，在那里定居下来。"]},{"type":"verse","number":32,"content":["他拉在那里去世，享年二百零五岁",{"noteId":9},"。"]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":9,"caller":"+","text":"“二百零五岁”有古卷作“一百四十五岁”。","reference":{"chapter":11,"verse":32}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/GEN/11.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/GEN/12.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/GEN/10.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":32}